\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">3fbba759-fa7c-4e36-b861-058ea4d8a75d</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:3fbba759-fa7c-4e36-b861-058ea4d8a75d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:3fbba759-fa7c-4e36-b861-058ea4d8a75d\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In <a href=\"/wiki/Nortale%27s_Hostel\" title=\"Nortale's Hostel\">Nortale's Hostel</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;90&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-56</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>Nortale's Hostel - House Rules<br><br>\n1. Be considerate, everybody is going through something.<br><br>\n2. Make a mess, clean it up.<br><br>\n3. No ritual sacrifices on the back porch - use a cutting board on the prep table.<br><br>\n4. No singing or dancing after sundown.<br><br>\n5. One bucket of clean water per use of the wash tub.<br><br>\n6. No 'intimacy clients' in the dormitory - I'm serious.<br><br>\nPammella Nortale\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202148\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.050 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.054 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1627/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 30828/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7858/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 